2 TITL Exhibit for Quay Restaurant 1963
2 NOTE Inga Marie loved to paint pictures.  She took a painting class shortly before she left Norway in 1906.  It was 30 years later when she took out her paints again.  Her painting goal was that all of her children and grandchildren wo
3 CONC uld have at least one of her oil paintings.  
3 CONT The Quay restaurant in Vancouver Washington, would display her paintings when they had exhibits of local artists.  She chose these pictures to exhibit from November 4th to December 2nd 1963.
