2 TITL Inga Marie in Tromsø with friends Peder and Anne Størkersen - 1904
2 NOTE Inga and Anne were best friends growing up in Kaldfarnes.  In the stories Inga wrote about Kaldfarnes though, she calls herJana.
3 CONT In 1951, Anne and her husband Hilmar Pederson lived in Seattle Washington.  Inga came for a visit, and ended up getting a job as a cook for a family in The Highlands.
