3 CONT Your Mother also went to Texas in 1942.  She was a bridesmaid at the wedding of Elaine and Joe Loney.  Do you remember Ralph and Ruth Severson?  Ralph was also stationed in Texas, and Ruth was a bridesmaid for Elaine too.
2 NOTE Thanks Marilyn.  Never knew my mom went to Texas!  Is that your dad's cap?
