1 NAME Jens /Fordelsen/
2 GIVN Jens
2 SURN Fordelsen
2 _MARNM Fordelsen
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE JUN 1712
2 PLAC Fagerlia, Nord-Rana, Nordland, Norway
