2 NOTE Us kid's first riding horse - Elliott Prairie, OR in the 1940;s.  One time I rode her and she didn't want to leave home.  Well, it was a different story coming back.  I couldn't get her to slow down and she made a 90 degree turn i
3 CONC nto our yard and I went flying off.   Another time I she snapped at me and took a small
3 CONT piece of my new sweater,  I wonder if she had anything to do with my never really learning to ride.  I tried quite a few times, quite a few diffeent horses and there was always an element of fear.  I kind of think the horses knew 
3 CONC it.  My last ride was on one of Signe's horses, possibly as late as 2003 or 4.  Helen
