3 CONT early spring of 1945.  Dr. Sims house in the background.
3 CONT Ruth and Billy stayed for a while in Woodburn too.  Then she decided to take Billy and return to Virginia.  Uncle Bill was
3 CONT killed in the Battle of Ormoc Bay in the Philippines in December of 1944.  Billy was the only grandchild of his parents in Virginia.
