2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT Bygdebok page 437 - was born in 1807, and married Iver Hansen from Medby.  Helene and Iver did not fish much.  They had two cows, nine sheep, four goats, two pigs, and a horse.  Iver was blind for five years before he died in 1876
2 CONC .
2 CONT
2 CONT Their children - Arne Iversen born 1831, Dorthea Iversdatter born 1833, Hans Edvard Iversen born 1835, Bergitta Iversdatter born 1837, Jakobina Iversdatter born 1842, Ingeborg Sofie Iversdatter born 1844.
2 CONT
