1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Born at Storbjerkmo. Baptized May 25 1843 (Ministerialbok Mo (Nord- Rana) 1842 - 1852, p. 10, no. 30)  http://www.arkivverket.no/URN:NBN:no-a1450-kb20050427030626.jpg
2 CONT
2 CONT Census 1865: Lives at Storbjerkmo (in Mo prestegjeld) with his mother (who is a widow) and his younger siblings.
2 CONT
2 CONT Census 1875: Lives at Findeidet, Hemnes.  Is widowed and a fisherman by profession. His son Jacob Deodor lives with him.
2 CONT
2 CONT Census 1900: Lives at Finneid (gnr 53/bnr 1) with his second wife, Anna Olsdatter, and their daughter Karen Johansdatter.  He is a farmer.
2 CONT
2 CONT Died December 15 1902, buried January 2 1903 (gikk gjennom isen ved Røså, gjennfunnet ved Bjerka)(Ministerialbok Hemnes 1890 - 1909, p. 63, no. 20)  http://www.arkivverket.no/URN:NBN:no-a1450-kb20050921030270.jpg
